---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../../components/mindfulness/SectionHeading.astro';
import { pathTo } from '../../utils/paths';
---

<Layout title="Return and Refund Policy" description="Mindfulness Candle Collection return and refund policy.">
    <section class="section-padding bg-cream pt-32">
        <div class="container-narrow max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            <SectionHeading eyebrow="Policies" title="Return and Refund Policy" align="center" />

            <div class="card-static p-8 sm:p-12 space-y-8 text-warm-gray leading-relaxed font-light">
                <p>Your experience matters to us. If there is a problem with your order, please contact the Mindfulness Team so that we can evaluate the situation carefully.</p>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-charcoal mb-3 font-serif text-xl">Eligible Return Requests</h3>
                    <p>Return requests must be submitted within 14 calendar days of confirmed delivery. Products must ordinarily be unused, unopened, and returned in their original condition and packaging.</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-charcoal mb-3 font-serif text-xl">Nonreturnable Items</h3>
                    <p class="mb-4">For health, safety, and customization reasons, the following products may not be eligible for return:</p>
                    <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
                        <li>• Used or burned candles</li>
                        <li>• Opened fragrance products</li>
                        <li>• Personalized or custom products</li>
                        <li>• Gift cards</li>
                        <li>• Subscription boxes that have already shipped</li>
                        <li>• Final-sale or clearance merchandise</li>
                        <li>• Bulk, wholesale, fundraising, healthcare, or corporate orders unless otherwise stated in the applicable agreement</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-charcoal mb-3 font-serif text-xl">Damaged or Incorrect Products</h3>
                    <p>Please report damaged, defective, missing, or incorrect products within five calendar days of delivery. Include your order number and clear photographs of the product and packaging.</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-charcoal mb-3 font-serif text-xl">Approved Refunds</h3>
                    <p>Approved refunds will be issued to the original payment method. Original shipping charges are ordinarily nonrefundable. Processing times may vary depending on the financial institution.</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-charcoal mb-3 font-serif text-xl">Return Shipping</h3>
                    <p>Unless the return results from our error or an approved product-quality issue, return-shipping expenses are the customer's responsibility. Do not return products without first receiving return instructions from our team.</p>
                </div>

                <p>To request assistance, contact <a href="mailto:info@mindfulnesscandle.store" class="text-sage-dark font-medium">info@mindfulnesscandle.store</a> and include your order number.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center mt-10">
                <a href={pathTo('/policies/shipping')} class="btn btn-outline text-charcoal border-charcoal/30">Shipping Policy</a>
                <a href={pathTo('/policies/subscription')} class="btn btn-outline text-charcoal border-charcoal/30">Subscription Policy</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
